Rule 50 (If the ellipsis mask is set, then the shape can at most has one element less than the rank of dy)
{ellipsis_mask: int, shape: tensor, dy: tensor} |= if ellipsis_mask = 1 then shape(shape, 0) ≤ (ndim(dy) -1)
